<p>To modify an existent link, use the menu: <em>Favorites/Open</em>. Then  
in the Open Panel: </p>

<ol>
<li>Open your Home Favorites folder.</li>
<li>Select and open the desired ".url" file.</li>
<li>Modify the needed fields: <i>name</i>, <i>link</i>.</li>
<li>Click on the "Save Link" button to apply the made changes.</li>
</ol>

<note>
If you changed the name field, you will save a new Internet Shortcut  
under this new name file. The previous one will not be deleted.
</note>
